<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-QuadraMed started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-QuadraMed started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst Benjamin Rooks said he started coverage of QuadraMed Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>Shares in the healthcare information systems (HIS) firm were unchanged at 9-3/8.</p>
<p>&quot;Offering handsome profits, low P/Es and, recently with expanded coverage from the Street, improved trading volume, QuadraMed is the exception to the small-cap HIS universe and a name that we are convinced won't disappoint,&quot; Rooks said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
